'''Catway''' is a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] who was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]] and can be unlocked when beating the stage [[No Plan A (Deadly)|Clionel Ascendant]] appearing on the '''7th''', '''8th''', '''21st''' and '''22nd''' of every month. [[True Form]] was added in [[Version 8.3 Update|Version 8.3]] and increases health and attack power. This unit was later added into [[The Battle Cats Unite!|The Battle Cats Unite]] in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]] but was later obtainable in the [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.7 Update|September 15, 2023 Update Patch]].

