==Trivia==
*Time Traveller Cat is a reference to the Japanese anime series ''[[wikia:Doraemon:Doraemon (manga)|Doraemon]]'', in which the [[wikia:Doraemon:Doraemon|titular protagonist]] is a robotic cat from the future. The vehicle looks similar to the [[wikia:Doraemon:Time Machine|time machine]] that Doraemon has hidden inside the drawer of Nobita's desk, and the Japanese description can be referring to the fact that the two characters often accidentally slip into Shizuka's bathroom when manipulating the gadgets.
*Catway is the first Advent unit to be released in The Battle Cats Unite.

